== Phase 1: Vendor history selection and assessment validation (pure helpers) ==
Provider: codex
Model: gpt-5.4
Status: starting Codex phase run.
**Phase 1** is implemented and kept scoped to the pure-helper work.

I updated the authority policy to version `3` and added `flag-payment-request` at authority level `3`. I added `lib/roles/riskAssess.js` with only the Phase 1 helpers: vendor ID normalization, vendor-history selection, fenced JSON parsing, and strict assessment normalization/validation. I also updated the stale `v2` assertion in `test/phase5.test.js` and added focused coverage in `test/riskAssess.test.js`.

**Status:** Phase 1 helper behavior is working and the focused tests pass.

**Verification:** I ran `node --test test/riskAssess.test.js`, `node --test test/phase5.test.js`, `npm install`, and `npm run check`. The Phase 1 tests passed. The full repo check still fails in this workspace for unrelated pre-existing issues outside this phase, mainly missing external `e3d-trade` files and broken AWS SES dependency resolution (`@aws-sdk/client-ses` / `@smithy/core/retry`) in other suites.

I also wrote the required handoff to [.codex-spec-runner/summaries/phase-1.md](/var/folders/vn/jrwn6x0579v_26grcpvwp_200000gn/T/e3d-pilot.impl-5802bc1f2fe4-repo-20260918062109.kfqMkM/.codex-spec-runner/summaries/phase-1.md).
